{"1462990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rushaug: Feline Warfare", "steam_appid": 1462990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/c6cb2f1fead690701ebbae0c3dc7fa47.avif?t=1785751220\" alt=\"A cat in a spacesuit holding an assault rifle, and a text saying: &quot;Cats have taken to space, and they&#039;re bringing nuclear weapons.&quot;\" width=474 height=651 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rushaug: Feline Warfare</strong> (formerly known as <strong>Project Emerald</strong>) is a polished single-player experience with tons of guns, espionage, military jargon, and enormous replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/a7694255fd7c87e6b8073c57ab103f7f.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Showcasing the 8 missions included in the game.\" width=1032 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/a7694255fd7c87e6b8073c57ab103f7f.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/ddda1759b8ac1d88ca3777be9b1b6fc7.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Showcasing the 40+ weapons included in the game.\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/ddda1759b8ac1d88ca3777be9b1b6fc7.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/ddda1759b8ac1d88ca3777be9b1b6fc7.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/c7ae3af6e604275485ad452ac0768989.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/c7ae3af6e604275485ad452ac0768989.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/c7ae3af6e604275485ad452ac0768989.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/bdbcb16aeeb531044341c209e2a79e13.apng?t=1785751220\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/bdbcb16aeeb531044341c209e2a79e13.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=44 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is torn apart by ideology, ultra-nationalism, and cat breed-racialism.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of this instability, collective powers are trying to insert their influence through force. <strong>Global Alliance Treaty Organization (GATO)</strong>, a joint military force, is fighting to defend independent nations from being grasped by the mighty <strong>Dekenzian Manifesto Allegiance (DMA)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rushaug</strong>–an elite soldier operating behind enemy lines–is gathering critical information, all while sabotaging the enemy from the inside. His accomplishments do not go unnoticed, and he is quickly building a reputation as a formidable opponent. The DMA is determined to stop the threat, prompting <strong>General Zargasso</strong> to dispatch special forces to hunt down and eliminate Rushaug. Unknowingly, Rushaug is about to meet his equal; <strong>Red Nuke</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/32c3e83d4db65162bc078971f12c3b6d.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/32c3e83d4db65162bc078971f12c3b6d.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/32c3e83d4db65162bc078971f12c3b6d.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/227fe0b61f72397dfca696fdeff6f777.apng?t=1785751220\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/227fe0b61f72397dfca696fdeff6f777.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=44 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> a range of locations — the freezing arctic, an unbearably hot desert, a deep and claustrophobic bunker hidden in the woods, a Guerrilla-occupied old rum distillery on an island paradise, and even venture into space to another planet!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/0ff9f39a938b6d417fe2825339422144.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Various gameplay footage.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/0ff9f39a938b6d417fe2825339422144.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/0ff9f39a938b6d417fe2825339422144.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFILTRATE</strong> hostile settlements ranging from remote outposts to top-secret military bases. Use stealth to your advantage, or go guns blazing with the heaviest hardware you can get your paws on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Various gameplay footage.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENGAGE</strong> in combat against enemies such as the skilled infantry of the DMA, experienced guerrilla fighters in Catvador, or take on the feared Bolse Death Squadron. The game puts huge emphasis on gunplay, and realistic bullet velocity, so it is all about quick reactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/42d426feb40072f031dde038a682a2fc.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Various gameplay footage.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/42d426feb40072f031dde038a682a2fc.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/42d426feb40072f031dde038a682a2fc.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> intel to reveal new locations and gun schematics to unlock <strong>40+</strong> different weapons to choose from.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/f4f89fce10070627f93a858a65d6628c.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage of the Space Missions.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/f4f89fce10070627f93a858a65d6628c.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/f4f89fce10070627f93a858a65d6628c.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER</strong> the true purpose of <strong>Project Emerald</strong> and save the free world from a nuclear holocaust.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/16f75044539c3d847eca454d5ac0a3cf.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/16f75044539c3d847eca454d5ac0a3cf.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/16f75044539c3d847eca454d5ac0a3cf.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/ae55ff715bea2113402e8015f2aa1923.avif?t=1785751220\" alt=\"An image encouraging viewers to join the Discord.\" width=616 height=204 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/bde32a841d187e822baf38fe0a220415.webp?t=1785751220\" width=180 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rushaug: Feline Warfare has been a passion project more than <strong>14 years</strong> in the making. After an excruciating amount of work as a solo developer, ups and downs, challenges and hurdles; it is a dream come true to have you view this page right now. If you're passionate about stealth games, shooters, and platformers, and happen to like cats as well, I think you're going to enjoy this experience very much.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/2d7da64b6e955ffd21298d18257b648b.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/2d7da64b6e955ffd21298d18257b648b.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/2d7da64b6e955ffd21298d18257b648b.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"b