.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/0ff9f39a938b6d417fe2825339422144.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/0ff9f39a938b6d417fe2825339422144.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFILTRATE</strong> hostile settlements ranging from remote outposts to top-secret military bases. Use stealth to your advantage, or go guns blazing with the heaviest hardware you can get your paws on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Various gameplay footage.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.webm?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/85b9f67af2a4add58111ad1ff5b2798d.mp4?t=1785751220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENGAGE</strong> in combat against enemies such as the skilled infantry of the DMA, experienced guerrilla fighters in Catvador, or take on the feared Bolse Death Squadron. The game puts huge emphasis on gunplay, and realistic bullet velocity, so it is all about quick reactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1462990/extras/42d426feb40072f031dde038a682a2fc.poster.avif?t=1785751220\" aria-label=\"Various gameplay footage.\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https: